# DM map images are local-only by default (copyright + binaries-out policy).
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp

# EXCEPTION: the 2048px display images ARE committed so the deployed site renders the
# world + regional maps (size is acceptable; each ~600 KB). Built by
